# ─── NovauOS base package list ──────────────────────────────────────────
#
# This is the chroot package list. live-build will install every package
# listed here into the squashfs. Keep it as small as possible.
#
# Every package name in this file has been verified against the Debian 12
# (bookworm) package indices for main/contrib/non-free/non-free-firmware
# plus bookworm-updates and bookworm-security. See the audit script in
# .github/scripts/audit-packages.sh.
#
# Package renames we applied (vs the original list):
#   sof-firmware          → firmware-sof-signed   (renamed in bookworm)
#   qogir-icon-theme      → (removed; not in bookworm; papirus + adwaita are enough)
#   appstream-qt          → (removed; the Qt bindings were dropped; appstream itself stays)
#   wine32                → (removed; wine + wine64 cover it; wine32 pulls in lib32 multilib)
#   bottles               → (removed; not in bookworm apt; ship via Flathub in novau-store)
#   libgl1-nvidia-glx     → (removed; nvidia-driver already pulls in libgl1-nvidia-glvnd-glx)

