# ── GPU drivers ──
# nvidia-driver (535.x in bookworm) is the metapackage; it pulls in
# nvidia-driver-libs, nvidia-driver-bin, xserver-xorg-video-nvidia,
# nvidia-vdpau-driver, nvidia-alternative, nvidia-kernel-dkms.
# We explicitly list nvidia-vulkan-icd + libnvidia-encode1 so the
# Vulkan ICD and NVENC are installed even if the metapackage's Suggests
# field isn't honoured by live-build.
nvidia-driver
nvidia-kernel-dkms
nvidia-vdpau-driver
nvidia-vulkan-icd
libnvidia-encode1
nvidia-smi
nvidia-settings
nvidia-persistenced
firmware-amd-graphics
mesa-vulkan-drivers
libgl1-mesa-dri
vulkan-tools

